{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","title":"Recurring Patterns vs Incidents","description":"Membedakan antara kesalahan tunggal (khilaf) dengan pola kepribadian yang sistematis.","tags":["psychology","behavior","personality"],"custom":{"description":"Membedakan antara kesalahan tunggal (khilaf) dengan pola kepribadian yang sistematis."},"fname":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"28979c65ec0e80e4d1a22071595fabd6","updated":1782198659094,"created":1782198659094,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","id":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","id":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.behavior","alias":"behavior","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.behavior"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","id":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.personality","alias":"personality","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.personality"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","id":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":11,"offset":1297},"end":{"line":19,"column":58,"offset":1344},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","id":"notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":11,"offset":1358},"end":{"line":28,"column":63,"offset":1410},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting","id":"notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":52,"offset":1230},"end":{"line":23,"column":104,"offset":1282},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.recurring-patterns-vs-incidents"}],"anchors":{"recurring-patterns-vs-incidents":{"type":"header","text":"Recurring Patterns vs Incidents","value":"recurring-patterns-vs-incidents","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"core-concept":{"type":"header","text":"Core Concept","value":"core-concept","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"incident-vs-pattern":{"type":"header","text":"Incident vs Pattern","value":"incident-vs-pattern","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-logic-of-the-program":{"type":"header","text":"The Logic of the Program","value":"the-logic-of-the-program","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2},"fixing-the-pattern":{"type":"header","text":"Fixing the Pattern","value":"fixing-the-pattern","line":29,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"recurring-patterns-vs-incidents\">Recurring Patterns vs Incidents<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#recurring-patterns-vs-incidents\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"recurring-patterns-vs-incidents-1\">Recurring Patterns vs Incidents<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#recurring-patterns-vs-incidents-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"core-concept\">Core Concept<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-concept\"></a></h2>\n<p>Penting untuk membedakan antara kejadian tunggal (<em>incident</em>) dengan pola yang berulang (<em>pattern</em>). Pola berulang adalah perilaku, respons emosi, atau cara memilih relasi yang muncul berkali-kali dalam berbagai konteks.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Pola berulang mengubah masalah dari \"apa yang terjadi?\" menjadi \"sistem apa yang terus memproduksi ini?\".</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"incident-vs-pattern\">Incident vs Pattern<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#incident-vs-pattern\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Incident (Khilaf)</strong>: Terjadi sekali, seringkali karena ketidaktahuan, stres sesaat, atau miskomunikasi. Contoh: Sekali meledak karena tekanan kerja yang ekstrem.</li>\n<li><strong>Pattern (Sifat/Kepribadian)</strong>: Terjadi secara sistematis meskipun individu tahu tindakan tersebut buruk atau merugikan. Contoh: Setiap kali dikritik, selalu menyerang balik atau melakukan <em>silent treatment</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-logic-of-the-program\">The Logic of the Program<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-logic-of-the-program\"></a></h2>\n<p>Pola berulang bukan muncul karena \"satu klik salah\", melainkan karena \"logika program internal\" yang memang demikian. Jika pola tetap dipertahankan meskipun dampaknya sudah diketahui, hal ini mulai masuk ke wilayah karakter atau gangguan kepribadian.</p>\n<h2 id=\"fixing-the-pattern\">Fixing the Pattern<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#fixing-the-pattern\"></a></h2>\n<p>Memperbaiki pola berulang tidak cukup dengan sekadar meminta maaf atas satu kejadian. Perbaikan harus menyasar pada <strong>perubahan logika internal</strong> yang memproduksi perilaku tersebut.</p>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">behavior (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">personality (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.mapping-behavioral-patterns\">Mapping and Mitigating Behavioral Patterns</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trauma-learning-reparenting\">Trauma-Informed Learning and Reparenting</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle"